timestamp=2026-11-04T16:05:34.210Z level=INFO run=b196681e message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 << 'PY'\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# So physical onset at 17:58Z (observed at 18:00Z). Alarms start at 18:00Z for TURB_OUTPUT - consistent.\n# Let us look at what happens to STEAM_PRES_01 around 19:59Z (its physical onset in UTC)\ndf1 = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/sensors_01.csv')\ndf2 = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/sensors_02.csv')\ndf3 = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/sensors_03.csv')\nmeta = pd.read_csv('/app/dataset/sensor_metadata.csv')\nmeta = meta.set_index('sensor_id')\n\ndf1['timestamp'] = pd.to_datetime(df1['timestamp']).dt.tz_localize(None)\ndf2['timestamp'] = pd.to_datetime(df2['timestamp']).dt.tz_localize(None)\ndf3['timestamp'] = pd.to_datetime(df3['timestamp']).dt.tz_localize(None)\ndf = pd.concat([df1, df2, df3], ignore_index=True)\ndf['offset_h'] = df['sensor_id'].map(lambda s: meta.loc[s, 'logger_utc_offset_hours'])\ndf['timestamp_utc'] = df['timestamp'] - pd.to_timedelta(df['offset_h'], unit='h')\n\nsp = df[df['sensor_id']=='STEAM_PRES_01'].sort_values('timestamp_utc')\nprint(sp[(sp['timestamp_utc'] >= pd.Timestamp('2024-01-15 19:50:00')) & \n         (sp['timestamp_utc'] <= pd.Timestamp('2024-01-15 20:10:00'))].to_string(index=False))\nPY" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
